<title>FINLAND: PUUHAMAA 6-MTH PRE-TAX PROFIT DOWN 30 PCT.</title>
<headline>PUUHAMAA 6-MTH PRE-TAX PROFIT DOWN 30 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Oct 31-</p>
<p>					 (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinaries, taxes     8.7 vs 12.5</p>
<p> Net sales					 21.7 vs 27.1</p>
<p> Operating profit				 8.1 vs 12.2</p>
<p> Profit before reserves, taxes		8.7 vs 12.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish amusement park company is</p>
<p>Tervakosken Puuhamaa Oy.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
